# Practice / smoke-test projects: live runs of any mode (`cleanvibe new`,
# `cleanvibe replicate` against arXiv:2605.20919 "Sutra", ...). Each run
# scaffolds a full project with its own nested git repo here; none of it is
# committed. The directory itself is kept (via .gitkeep) so it always exists.
# The /* form is needed: git cannot re-include a file under a directory that is
# ignored outright.
tests/scratch/*
!tests/scratch/.gitkeep
